+
+## Board Publication
+
+A board can be published behind a secret public URL that allows anyone to view it without authentication. Only board administrators can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board. The board's `public_url` will be populated in subsequent responses.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created`.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board, revoking the secret public URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content`.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
